# Normalise to LF in the repository. Developed on Windows, but Garry's Mod
# servers are as often Linux, and mixed endings make diffs unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Game content is binary, and stated rather than detected. text=auto gets this
# right nearly always, and "nearly" is the wrong bar for model and texture
# files: a single mangled byte is an invisible corruption that shows up as a
# missing model in game and as nothing at all in a diff.
#
# .vmt is deliberately absent - it really is a text file.
*.mdl binary
*.vtx binary
*.vvd binary
*.phy binary
*.ani binary
*.vtf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
